   "en": "Incentive"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "인센티브"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Taekyung, the CEO of Sona Cosmetics, is a flawless and coldly rational boss.\nYuju, who had been harboring a one-sided love for him,\ngrows weary of being seen only as his chief secretary.\nUnable to suppress her feelings any longer,\nshe submits her resignation after a year of silent longing.\nBut then...\n\n“I forgot to give you your incentive.”\n“What do you mean...?”\n“I’ll give you what you want most.”\n“Sorry?”\n“Even if it means offering my body—your incentive.”\n\nWithout hesitation, he places his hand over her white blouse.\n\n“But before we do this, let me make one thing clear. If you pull away again afterward, I won’t hold back next time.”\n\nA secret temptation approaches her just as she tries to quit—\u003cIncentive\u003e."
  },
